==Battleground==
*2 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Johnnyleon]] spawns as the boss after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 86.67~93.33 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Koronium]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A simple stage: just kill the first Gory Dark with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], then start stacking [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critters]] and [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance attackers]] like [[Volley Cat (Rare Cat)|Curry Cat]], [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]], and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]. Use the money from Gory Dark to deploy a few [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shields]], namely [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Mightycat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], for when Johnnyleon meets his demise.

The Tackey will hopefully be dealt with slowly via Pizza Cat's [[Wave Attack]]s.

